  patch version. Private inputs and unrelated untracked work are excluded.
- 2026-11-08: Preserved the failed source-gate exit and narrowed investigation
  to the GUI path rather than treating completed assertions as a passing run.
  The workflow lint passed using the existing tool. Native theme storage's
  actual timestamp still matches the captured post-correction snapshot.
- 2026-11-08: Added a failing ownership regression, corrected desktop shutdown
  and fixture lifetime, and preserved the original native-failure receipt.
  These changes remove a demonstrated lifecycle gap, not a claim about the
  exact native heap-corruption stack. Source and frozen gates must exit zero.
- 2026-11-08: Corrected tutorial/window/widget selection: 40 passed, exit zero,
  with no retained top-level Qt widgets. The subsequent complete local suite
  passed 698 tests and exited normally; original release lint/format/type
  gates passed without suppressing the prior native failure.
- 2026-11-08: Published the reviewed source and ten fictional screenshots,
  observed successful exact-source main/tag qualification and downloaded the
  stable release's actual assets. Verified all integrity layers and installed
