- 2026-11-08: The first verified local installation reached atomic directory
  rename but failed with WinError 5. A bounded empty-directory rename probe
  succeeded; the second complete integrity/install attempt succeeded without
  permission or security-policy changes. The denial's exact cause is unknown.
- 2026-11-08: Installed offline smoke and separate native GUI/CLI standalone
  tutorials plus normal-window F1 checks passed. Temporary qualification state
  was removed; private inputs and captured post-error preferences were preserved.
  Complete this bounded release only; preserve the original live review gaps.
